.TH tumd 1 0.29.0 tclutils "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tumd \- command-line wrapper for tclutils::tumd.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tclsh bin/tumd.tcl html ?file.md?
tclsh bin/tumd.tcl toc ?file.md?
tclsh bin/tumd.tcl headings ?file.md?
tclsh bin/tumd.tcl frontmatter ?file.md?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Reads Markdown from a file or standard input and prints HTML, a table of
contents, heading list, or front matter.
.SH SEE ALSO
tumd(n)
